<%# ── BIO ── %>
<section class="about-bio-section">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="about-main">
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <div class="about-title">
          <h2>Pratima Gaikwad</h2>
          <p class="about-role">Founder &amp; Principal Designer – Interior with Pratima Gaikwad</p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-description">
          <p>
            Pratima is a Pune-based interior designer with 3+ years of experience and 30+ completed projects. She specialises in warm, modern interiors that feel welcoming, balanced and easy to maintain. Her work reflects a blend of aesthetics, functionality and the unique personality of each homeowner.
          </p>
          <p>
            Her design style focuses on simple layouts, natural colours and smart storage solutions. She believes that every home should be beautiful without being cluttered, and that even small spaces can feel open and comfortable with the right planning and material choices.
          </p>
          <p>
            Pratima has worked on Residential, Commercial and Industrial projects across Pune and nearby areas. She has a strong interest in transforming compact spaces into practical and elegant homes, ensuring that each design supports everyday living while looking timeless and stylish.
          </p>
          <blockquote class="about-quote">
            "A home should feel peaceful, personal and easy to maintain."
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-image-wrapper reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <img src="/img/pratima.jpeg" alt="Pratima Gaikwad - Interior Designer" class="about-image" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

